{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Galactic Conquest",
    "steam_appid": 3350350,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey with Galactic Conquest Universe, the pioneering real-time strategy game that redefines the genre with live voxel terrain deformation. Watch as landscapes shift under the fire of your weapons\u2014reshaping tactics on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command one of six distinct factions, each with unique units, buildings, and playstyles. Master your economy via a comprehensive marketplace where healthy trade can fuel your war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in Unity with a charming low\u2011poly aesthetic, Galactic Conquest Universe balances approachable visuals with deep, dynamic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your battlefield: intense PvP 1\u2011on\u20111 matches on compact maps, or test your endurance in survival mode\u2014now to level 15, with limitless future rounds, boss waves, and new biomes on the roadmap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With continuous post-launch support\u2014adding maps, factions, UI enhancements, and more\u2014your battlefield will evolve long after launch. Add to your wishlist and get ready to lead your faction through a shifting warzone.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey with Galactic Conquest Universe, the pioneering real-time strategy game that redefines the genre with live voxel terrain deformation. Watch as landscapes shift under the fire of your weapons\u2014reshaping tactics on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command one of six distinct factions, each with unique units, buildings, and playstyles. Master your economy via a comprehensive marketplace where healthy trade can fuel your war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in Unity with a charming low\u2011poly aesthetic, Galactic Conquest Universe balances approachable visuals with deep, dynamic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your battlefield: intense PvP 1\u2011on\u20111 matches on compact maps, or test your endurance in survival mode\u2014now to level 15, with limitless future rounds, boss waves, and new biomes on the roadmap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With continuous post-launch support\u2014adding maps, factions, UI enhancements, and more\u2014your battlefield will evolve long after launch. Add to your wishlist and get ready to lead your faction through a shifting warzone.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an epic journey in Galactic Conquest Universe, a real-time strategy game with dynamic voxel terrain deformation. Choose from six unique factions, manage resources, and adapt to evolving battlefields. Experience innovative gameplay and tactical depth. Wishlist now!",
